  ('896556b7-9773-5b48-b219-41a24f615ac5', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g10-argument-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$A skeptical reader questions the estimate in sentence (9). Which added information would make that estimate most convincing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The estimate is based on the district's own repair records from the past three years.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The technology office has six employees and is located in the district headquarters.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Other districts may also be thinking about switching to repairable laptops.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-evidence"},{"text":"Saving money is always a wise goal for any school district to pursue.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-general"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The estimate is based on the district's own repair records from the past three years.$q$, $q$Showing that the estimate comes from real local records makes the number credible and relevant. The office's size says nothing about whether its estimate is accurate.$q$, 'draft', '281e851b-ca46-5e9b-a469-57b06e7317bb')
