   $q$Which transition, added at the beginning of sentence (8), best shows that it responds to the worry in sentence (7)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-response"},{"text":"To address this concern,","is_correct":true},{"text":"In conclusion,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"summary-for-response"},{"text":"Similarly,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-response"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To address this concern,$q$, $q$Sentence (8) offers a solution to the parents' worry about lost time, so "To address this concern" makes that relationship clear. "For example" is wrong because shortening volleyball is not an example of the worry; it is an answer to it.$q$, 'draft', '1b5b026f-499d-58f0-890c-74bbe3061ad8')
